            0.146,
            0.123,
            0.655,
            0.162
          ],
          "content": "**Which decimal number is greater? (a) 1.23 or 1.32 (b) 3.81 or 13.800 (c) 1.009 or 1.090**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.177,
            0.368,
            0.263
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** (a) 1.32 is larger. (b) 13.800 is larger. (c) 1.090 is larger."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.279,
            0.71,
            0.337
          ],
          "content": "？ **Consider the decimal numbers 0.9, 1.1, 1.01 and 1.11 Which of the above is closest to 1.09? Ans:** 1.1 is closest to 1.09."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.352,
            0.7,
            0.372
          ],
          "content": "？ **Which among these is closest to 4: 3.56, 3.65, 3.099?**"
