          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.389,
            0.378,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** 3.65 is closest to 4."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.425,
            0.677,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": "? **Which among these is closest to 1: 0.8, 0.69, 1.08?**"
